really, really big deal. So let's talk about it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.680 --> 00:01:04.240
Democrat Held Tola Beats Palin in Alaska Special&nbsp;
Election Upset Reports Politico. Now remember,&nbsp;&nbsp;

